				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source type=&#34;image/avif&#34; srcset=&#34;https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_320x.avif 320w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_480x.avif 480w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_720x.avif 720w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_1080x.avif 1080w&#34; sizes=&#34;auto, (min-width: 1080px) 1080px, calc(100vw - 32px)&#34;&gt;&lt;source type=&#34;image/webp&#34; srcset=&#34;https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_320x.webp 320w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_480x.webp 480w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_720x.webp 720w, https://liudon.com/posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png_1080x.webp 1080w&#34; sizes=&#34;auto, (min-width: 1080px) 1080px, calc(100vw - 32px)&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;../../posts/use-avif-to-optimize-images-on-hugo/avif-on-hugo.png&#34; alt=&#34;avif-on-hugo&#34;&#xA;         width=&#34;1080&#34; height=&#34;328&#34;&#xA;         loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章会介绍基于Github Workflow使用ImageMagick生成AVIF图片，来优化Hugo站点的加载速度。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
